  "description": {
    "pve": {
      "en": "Hex Spell. Deals 10...70...85 cold damage to target and adjacent foes. For 5...17...20 seconds, target foe and all adjacent foes take twice as long to activate signets. If you are Overcast, foes struck with Rust have their signets interrupted and disabled for 1...8...10 second[s].",
      "zhTW": "持續5～20秒，對目標及其鄰近的敵人造成10～85冰凍傷害，並使這些敵人施展紋章時施法時間增加為2倍。"
    },
